Web3 Wallet Guard is a powerful application that focuses on helping users identify and eliminate risks in the field of encryption. It includes the following features:
1. Through a powerful AI intelligent detection program, it helps users detect whether the encrypted wallet applications installed on their devices are risky and detect fake wallets in advance;
2. It includes the mainstream dApp information in the current encryption market to help users judge dApp risk items and avoid risky projects;
3. Token detection: detect token holdings and liquidity distribution, discover token contract vulnerabilities and honeypot risks, and reduce the risk of users participating in meme coin transactions;
4. Wallet address risk tag query and order query. Help users find marked risk wallets and refuse to trade with them to avoid risks.

NOW Tracker is an official app by ChangeNOW – an instant cryptocurrency exchange service. Crypto tracker allows you to add any cryptocurrencies that you own to a single crypto portfolio and monitor their rates on the go through your profile.

Main features:
- One portfolio for all the crypto coins you hodl – the app collects all the balances and shows them in your local currency;
- An easy way to track – simply add your wallet address to update balances automatically or do it manually;
- Privacy – we store none of your data;
- Analytics – you see what assets are the most valuable in your portfolio;
- Crypto market monitoring – keep track of 7000+ top cryptocurrencies (Bitcoin, Ethereum, Tether, Monero and others). Update the price in real time;
- NFT section: track ERC-721 & ERC-1155 NFT tokens; display NFT's last sale price; display the price of NFT portfolio; hide NFT Portfolio display in Settings; back up your NFT collections to protect it; 
- No need for the registration – start using the tracker right away;
- 24/7 customer support – we're always ready to help you.

Two modes of tracking your crypto:
1. Auto tracking
Simply add the address of your crypto wallet, and we will automatically bring you the balance and your last transactions from different block explorers.
2. Manual tracking
Update the balances of your assets manually. We will put them together with the balances that are updated automatically.

Privacy
No personal data is collected and stored by NOW Tracker or any third party – the privacy of our users is our top priority. All data remains on your device and nowhere else, so no one but you can control it. You can delete it all anytime you want. We do not share your statistics with advertisers. For more security, use a 4-character pin or fingerprint authorization.

And yes, NOW Tracker is absolutely free to use with no restrictions.

We hope your crypto’s doing well – rest assured it is with NOW Tracker.

– The ChangeNOW Team

